  "note": "getProcessor returns the lambda `(externs, root) -> {...}`; it is written as a DSL lambda (DSL.md \"lambda\") whose body is evaluated at process time, so TypeCheck.processForTesting runs first, then setTypeCheckingHasRun(true), and only then are compiler.getModuleMetadataMap()/getModuleMap() read as Es6RewriteModules' constructor arguments, in the original order. The lambda reads the test field chunkOutputType; the field is never changed during a call (testFieldsAfter is empty for every record), so it is decoded from testFields, and the `if (chunkOutputType == ES_MODULES)` is resolved by case selection on the same field. The `new` expressions are direct, so --mutate-noop Es6RewriteModules (or TypeCheck, ConvertChunksToESModules) reaches them. moduleRoots is read only by getOptions and is replayed from the options diff. The record with processor=null (testImport_missing, a parse error) never calls the lambda."
